{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L05vJTIwSGFtYnVyZyUyME5vJTIwQmVhdGxlcyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"No Hamburg No Beatles","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jyxXoTAvoZt9FzgVS7d8ikMpsnO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/knmBxVqQOLbd8eqCelMjEUnbLID.jpg","description":"“We were born in Liverpool but grew up in Hamburg”, John Lennon once said. This feature documentary seeks to find the truth in those words. The long and winding road that the Beatles took to worldwide fame passed through Hamburg, Germany in the early 1960s. Only a couple of years before they became household names, the former Quarrymen were cutting their musical teeth on nightclub stages in the city. Hamburg had become the vice capital of Europe after World War Two, its neon-lit streets home to sailors, sex workers, drug dealers, gangs and low life. Meanwhile, the English band was still developing, still young and virtually unknown. By the time of their last German visit in 1966, the Beatles were an international phenomenon. 'No Hamburg, No Beatles' explains how learning their trade in this fascinating city helped propel them to global stardom.\n\nRated U · Released 6 Dec 2024 · GB · Language: English · 55 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.4","imdb_id":"tt21346810","moviedb_id":1401694,"tmdbId":1401694,"runtime":"55 min","cast":["Paul McCartney","John Lennon","George Harrison","Pete Best","Stuart Sutcliffe","Ringo Starr","Astrid Kirchherr","Klaus Voormann"],"director":["Roger Appleton"],"writer":["Roger Appleton"],"released":"2024-12-06T00:00:00.000Z","country":"GB","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Roger Appleton","character":"Director"},{"name":"Paul McCartney","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sCPsv9ueP5UR6BkMSmRDlwbra6S.jpg"},{"name":"John Lennon","character":"Se